! 168 = 96 x 1.75. On this 2880x1800 14-inch panel (~243 DPI) that renders a
! 12pt glyph at 28 device px. Drives i3, i3bar and alacritty.
! GTK apps get the same density from gsd-xsettings via
! org.gnome.desktop.interface scaling-factor=2 x text-scaling-factor=0.875,
! which also computes to 168 - so the two agree instead of fighting.
*dpi: 168
Xft.dpi: 168